<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Goriely & Tabor (1998) PRL / Gerbode et al. (2012) Science Kirchhoff elastic rod tendril perversion & G-fiber overwinding (Climbing plant tendrils (Cucumis sativus, Passiflora caerulea, Bryonia dioica, Echinocystis lobata))",
        "Goriely & Tabor (1998) PRL / Gerbode et al. (2012) Science Kirchhoff elastic rod tendril perversion & G-fiber overwinding faithfully reproduces Climbing plant tendrils (Cucumis sativus, Passiflora caerulea, Bryonia dioica, Echinocystis lobata) morphology" ;
