    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 1998-goriely-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Climbing plant tendrils (Cucumis sativus, Passiflora caerulea, Bryonia dioica, Echinocystis lobata) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 92.9/100, audit 2026-10-19-tendril-perversion-intrinsic-curvature-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
